"Default is 5 millimeters."
msgstr ""

#: old/KPrConfig.cpp:482
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vertical grid size:"
msgstr "Градиенти Амудӣ"

#: old/KPrConfig.cpp:483
msgid ""
